# ── What is NOT compared, and why (K-629) ────────────────────────────────────
#
# SCAN_ROOTS leaves the Rails skeleton out. These are the paths that exist in two
# or more demos and that nothing above compares; each line says what the copies
# are allowed to differ by.
#
# HONEST SCOPE, twice over.
#
# (1) These entries are DOCUMENTARY. Only their staleness is checked — a declared
#     path that no longer exists in two demos is an error — not their
